      <p>Pair rankings show where the easiest symbolic alignment and the biggest translation needs may be. This can explain why two people naturally carry conversation, why another pair works best with structure, or why a specific dynamic feels tense during planning. Keep the tone kind. Pair rankings are information, not social status.</p>
