      <p>Never use group compatibility to embarrass someone, explain them away, or create sides. If a result names friction, phrase it as a support question: "What would make this plan easier for everyone?" or "Where do we need clearer expectations?" For responsible use, read <a href="https://matchbybirth.com/blog/how-to-use-compatibility-results-responsibly">how to use compatibility results responsibly</a>.</p>
